  "bio": "Specializing in illustrative tattoo artistry, Ricky Esterby is a standout professional in the Fargo ink community. Operating out of Inked Huntress Tattoo, clientele trust Ricky's skill level as he consistently delivers intricate and personalized artwork. Despite a high demand leading to currently closed books, Ricky maintains impeccable standards of cleanliness, ensuring every client's experience is safe and hygienic.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Fargo, North Dakota, United States\n\n✖️Tattoo artist and co-owner: @feverdreamtattoo \n✖️Fargo, ND\n✖️For tattoo inquiries: info@feverdreamtattoo.com",
